      "cr": 0.125,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Dirty Brother.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 1, power rating 2 → CR 1/8 as a civilian. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Ash-Stained Brother</strong> — Snowdin Maintenance Crew</p><p>Status: Active — recorded in the Snowdin household registry</p><p>A soot-covered relation who repairs boiler shafts, chimneys, and old puzzle mechanisms. The green sparks around Dirty Brother are residue from ancient heating runes, not a curse—though he enjoys letting visitors think otherwise. His practical work keeps Snowdin warm when the magic in its infrastructure misbehaves.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Club</strong> — “The Ash-Stained Brother”</li><li><strong>Keen Records</strong> — “He describes the color as professional.”</li><li><strong>Mechanical Aptitude</strong> — “A soot-covered relation who repairs boiler shafts, chimneys, and old puzzle mechanisms.”</li><li><strong>Puzzle Discipline</strong> — “A soot-covered relation who repairs boiler shafts, chimneys, and old puzzle mechanisms.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/dirty_brother</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/dirty_brother</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
